# StudyBrain — Full-Stack AI Knowledge Base App

Building a Next.js 14 App Router application with Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Anthropic Claude AI, and localStorage persistence.

## Build Order

### Phase 1 — Scaffold
- Initialize Next.js 14 project in `d:\2brain\studybrain`
- Install all dependencies

### Phase 2 — Config
- `tailwind.config.ts` with custom tokens (Syne, DM Mono, lime-green accent)
- `app/globals.css`
- `.env.local`

### Phase 3 — Core Files
1. `app/layout.tsx` — Dark root layout with sidebar + main slots
2. `lib/store.ts` — localStorage helpers
3. `lib/types.ts` — TypeScript types

### Phase 4 — Components
4. `components/Sidebar.tsx`
5. `components/NewLessonModal.tsx`
6. `components/LessonView.tsx`
7. `components/WelcomeScreen.tsx`

### Phase 5 — API Route
8. `app/api/chat/route.ts` — Streaming Anthropic Claude endpoint

### Phase 6 — Main Page
9. `app/page.tsx` — Orchestrates sidebar + view states

## Verification
- Dev server starts without errors
- Can create/delete lessons
- File upload + parsing works
- Chat streams AI responses
